me":"Jacques-Imo's Cafe","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"8KnMSrMuTI2AtHZ2LOI8OQ","name":"Maurepas Foods","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"Zi-F-YvyVOK0k5QD7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"JhpRI9m71ybWHkAqRdL0Tg","name":"The Avenue Pub","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"_Bi9kN_eR75G1eqIl7S3pA","name":"The Bulldog","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"xv_U__GI9gmzKIHT_TANnw","review_id":"FcN164xcJROLY4gzfg2rhw","date":"2016-08-20T16:15:05","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9390510320663452,"text_excerpt":"I used to order sushi from here in my college days since it delivers until 2 am (and I may or may not be someone who craves asian food all the time... so late night is no exception) but I hadn't ordered from here in years. The other night some friends suggested we go, so I figured I would tag along. First things first, this restaurant is huge! There were a good amount of people here on a Wednesday around 10:30 but no where near enough to fill the place. This restaurant does a variety of asian food, it really is just a mixed bag. I decided to get the General Tso's combination plate with miso soup, a crab rangoon, and white rice. I was originally a little turned off by the price ($13.50 for..."},{"business_id":"xv_U__GI9gmzKIHT_TANnw","review_id":"Lfmr6g4bCTfU5-6hbXHCQg","date":"2013-06-09T02:02:48","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9369772672653198,"text_excerpt":"I'm going to try not to write the longest review ever. I am definitely a fan of Hoshun. It is close to my house, it is open late (yay for service industry folks), it has a diverse enough menu that my non-sushi-eating lady friend is pretty content to join me on my late-night sushi adventures, the food is good, the service is average to good (super props to Cynthia, who is actually great), the happy hour menu is nice, and the prices are reasonable. Since the menu is pretty expansive, I've been able to eat different things at each visit and been pleased each time. This also includes things friends have ordered and I'v gotten to try. I love food, but it'd be way too much on my own. Here's the..."},{"business_id":"xv_U__GI9gmzKIHT_TANnw","review_id":"aJKLngFOFV36t9Ob-RFKgg","date":"2013-10-06T01:52:01","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9358310103416443,"text_excerpt":"They serve sushi and they're open till 2am...that's a solid 3 stars right there. I usually pick up sushi from here at around 1am when the attack of the munchies happens. It's always packed around that time. The service is excellent as well...attentive yet not pushy. I got the miso soup and a California roll on my latest visit and they both were very filling. The California roll tasted a bit strange...like it had been prepped and stored for a few hours but it could be my mind playing tricks on me. Overall, cool place."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"xv_U__GI9gmzKIHT_TANnw","photo_id":"IeAoBvSxyY0vkMc4N-9tUg","label":"outside","image_url":"/photos/IeAoBvSxyY0vkMc4N-9tUg.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8936636447906494},{"business_id":"xv_U__GI9gmzKIHT_TANnw","photo_id":"dG79q-rRpCSG_rjFv4y28A","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/dG79q-rRpCSG_rjFv4y28A.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8897169828414917},{"business_id":"xv_U__GI9gmzKIHT_TANnw","photo_id":"Z5IR16nraloPwitakFGNjA","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/Z5IR16nraloPwitakFGNjA.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.831076443195343},{"business_id":"xv_U__GI9gmzKIHT_TANnw","photo_id":"n5R5WnE71IcjqiDM5CbnbQ","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/n5R5WnE71IcjqiDM5CbnbQ.jpg",